## ProjectOS storage boundary
# Google Drive is the source of truth for large media, delivery packages,
# executables and model weights. Existing tracked files are unaffected;
# a genuinely required small test fixture may be explicitly unignored in
# its project directory and documented there.

# Video / audio deliverables
*.mp4
*.mov
*.mkv
*.avi
*.webm
*.m4v
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.aac
*.flac
*.wav

# Archives and installers
*.zip
*.7z
*.rar
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.exe
*.msi
*.dmg
*.AppImage
*.iso

# Creative project binaries / model weights
*.psd
*.psb
*.procreate
*.aep
*.blend
*.onnx
*.safetensors
*.ckpt
*.pth
*.pt

